# Viability study: a cursed boss fight in the Cathedral (event battle 4; 4 = a Deuce, 5 = Gronk) with the
# curse_party_l10 party (Jian 10, Lucia 10, Gabryel 4, Port Olbeage gear) from full HP, everyone on Fight (A presses). Battle
# Logs Jian's battle HP every time it changes (battle Jian at [0x020B8620] + 0x14).
include boot_from_save
wait 30
include curse_party_l10
poke u32 0x02204624 0x80000
pin u16 0x020B77EC 141
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 4
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
peek u32 0x020B8620 battle_chars
battlers
watch u32 0x02291C34 b_jian_hp
watch u32 0x02291CA0 b_lucia_hp
watch u32 0x02291D0C b_gabryel_hp
watch u16 0x020B85C2 round
shot boss_start
press A 4
wait 40
